!!! Text without escapes, and the ergonomic/override type split.
area demo.text

!!! Ergonomic types are what a program says unless it has a reason not to.
answer   returns number   begin function give 42 end function
ratio    returns floating begin function give 0.5 end function
ready    returns boolean  begin function give true end function
greeting returns text     begin function give "hello" end function

!!! "override" marks every drop to a machine representation, so reaching for
!!! one is deliberate and greppable.
pack receives version as override byte, length as override long returns override long begin function
    give ((version becomes override long) shifted left by 16) bitwise or length
end function

main returns number begin function

    !!! A quoted literal is raw. No doubling, no backslashes.
    value path as text is "C:\dir\file.txt"
    value regex as text is "^[a-z]+\d*$"
    say path; say regex

    !!! A literal quote is the 'quote' constant, concatenated with 'plus' --
    !!! which is already text concatenation. There is no escape syntax.
    value said as text is "he said " plus quote plus "hi" plus quote
    say said

    !!! 'newline' and 'tab' likewise.
    say "one" plus newline plus "two"
    say "name" plus tab plus "value"

    !!! A raw block for anything awkward. Nothing inside is escaped, because
    !!! the terminator is a line-anchored keyword rather than a character.
    value banner as text is begin text
        He said "hi" and the path was C:\Users\me\file.txt
          this line keeps its extra indent
        {"json": "works too", "escaped": "nothing \n needed"}
    end text
    say banner

    give 0
end function
